# ===== SoundFont: not bundled in this repository =====
# The app expects ChoriumRevA.sf2 at build/runtime, but its license is not
# clearly redistributable, so it is intentionally kept out of version control.
# See README.md -> "Getting the SoundFont" for how to obtain and place it.
*.sf2
*.sf3
*.sfpack
